<nav-back />
<page-overlays />
<view class="page page-shell task-shell paper-grain dsf-page">
  <scroll-view scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}" class="page-doc">

  <block wx:if="{{stage === 'hunt'}}">
    <view class="task-kicker">大水法 · 本题</view>
    <view class="task-lead kaiti"><gloss-text parts="{{introParts}}" bind:glossary="onGlossary" /></view>
    <view class="task-lead kaiti">我翻了翻档案，正好找到了一幅《大水法南面》的铜版图。图中的石构轮廓和眼前能够对得上。但真正吸引我注意的，反而是前面的喷水池。不过水池中间怎么还有一只鹿？周围那些动物又是在做什么？</view>
    <view class="task-lead">先点一个构件，再点它原来的位置。</view>
    <audio-clip wx:if="{{narrSrc}}" src="{{narrSrc}}" autoplay="{{true}}" kind="voice" label="听 · 本页讲述" />
    <view class="dsf-plate">
      <image class="dsf-plate-img" src="/plate21/module/assets/img/plate-dashuifa.jpg" mode="widthFix" />
    </view>
    <view class="dsf-zones">
      <view wx:for="{{zones}}" wx:key="key" class="dsf-zone" data-zone="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onDrop">{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="dsf-pieces">
      <view wx:for="{{pieces}}" wx:key="key" class="dsf-piece {{holding === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onHold">{{item.label}}{{placed[item.key] ? ' · 已放回' : ''}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint" wx:if="{{huntHint}}">{{huntHint}}</view>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="task-lead kaiti">原来这些动物并不是随便摆在喷泉里的装饰。鹿站在中间，猎狗围在周围，水流一喷起来，周围十只铜猎狗同时向鹿喷水，组成“猎狗逐鹿”的场景。而对面的观水法，正是皇帝当年观赏喷泉的地方。</view>
    <view class="dsf-plate dsf-break">
      <image class="dsf-plate-img" src="/plate21/module/assets/img/plate-dashuifa.jpg" mode="widthFix" />
    </view>
    <view class="task-lead kaiti">铜鹿不在了，猎狗不在了，喷水塔也不在了。刚刚还完整存在于屏幕里的景象，现实中只剩下石构的轮廓。</view>
  </block>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="task-dock">
    <button wx:if="{{stage === 'hunt'}}" class="btn-seal" bindtap="onHuntConfirm">放好了</button>
    <button wx:else class="btn-seal" bindtap="onNext" disabled="{{advancing}}">{{advancing ? '正在前往……' : '前往雨果雕像'}}</button>
  </view>

  <!-- 术语史料卡（「大水法」SL-14 点入） -->
  <history-card
    wx:if="{{gloss}}"
    visible="{{!!gloss}}"
    title="{{gloss.title}}"
    source="{{gloss.source}}"
    lines="{{gloss.lines}}" layered="{{gloss.layered}}" image="{{gloss.image}}" caption="{{gloss.caption}}"
    btn-text="学到了"
    bind:next="onGlossClose"
    bind:close="onGlossClose"
  />
</view>
